   "llmNormalized": false,
   "rawText": "Additional Courses: Require a grade of C or better\nSelect 3 credits from the following: 3\nGER 100German Culture and Civilization\nGER 115NScience, Humanity and Catastrophe: Scientific Discovery in Germany\nGER 128NThe Holocaust in Film and Literature\nGER 131Gender and Sexuality in Weimar Berlin, 1918 - 1933\nGER 143The Culture of Stalinism and Nazism\nGER 166Marx, Nietzsche, Freud\nGER 175Germanic Heroic and Medieval Literature in English Translation\nGER 189NGerman Film\nGER 200NContemporary German Culture\nSelect 9 credits in German literature and culture from the following:9\nGER 431Dragons, the Divine and the Demonic: German Literature, Culture and Media--Medieval to 1750\nGER 432Worlds, Wars, and the Self: German Culture from the Enlightenment to the Present\nGER 440Seminar in German Literature, Media and Culture\nGER 456Migration and Multilingualism\nGER 457Horror, Terror, Fantasy\nGER 458Sex and Media\nGER 459Forbidden Forests: Ecology and Storytelling\nSelect 3 credits in German linguistics and applied linguistics from the following:3\nGER 411The Teaching of German\nGER 412Introduction to German linguistics\nGER 430History of the German Language\nGER 435Varieties and dialects of German\nSelect 3 additional credits of German at the 300- or 400-level3\n"
  }
